<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
        /* 이메일 클라이언트 호환성을 위해 스타일은 하단처럼 인라인으로도 넣는 것이 좋습니다 */
        body { font-family: 'Pretendard', -apple-system, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
    </style>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9fafb;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: white; padding: 40px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
        
        <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E6007E, #FF1493); color: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
            <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px;">U+모바일 청구서</h1>
            <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0; opacity: 0.9;">{{header.billingMonth}} 청구 내역입니다</p>
        </div>

        <div style="padding: 30px 0;">
            <div style="background: #f3f4f6; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <h2 style="color: #E6007E; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">고객 정보</h2>
                <p style="margin: 5px 0;"><strong>이름:</strong> {{receiver.name}}</p>
                <p style="margin: 5px 0;"><strong>이메일:</strong> {{receiver.email}}</p>
                <p style="margin: 5px 0;"><strong>청구월:</strong> {{header.billingMonth}}</p>
            </div>

            <div style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; color: #E6007E; text-align: center; margin: 30px 0; padding: 20px; border-top: 2px solid #f3f4f6; border-bottom: 2px solid #f3f4f6;">
                청구 금액: {{billingSummary.totalAmount}}원
            </div>

            <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">
                <h2 style="color: #E6007E; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">상세 내역</h2>
                <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
                    <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;">
                        <td style="padding: 10px 0;">기본료</td>
                        <td style="text-align: right; padding: 10px 0;">{{billingSummary.baseFee}}원</td>
                    </tr>
                    {{#each details.overageItem}}
                    <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;">
                        <td style="padding: 10px 0;">{{this.name}}</td>
                        <td style="text-align: right; padding: 10px 0;">{{this.price}}원</td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                    {{#each details.discountItem}}
                    <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; color: #ff4d4d;">
                        <td style="padding: 10px 0;">{{this.name}} (할인)</td>
                        <td style="text-align: right; padding: 10px 0;">-{{this.amount}}원</td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="text-align: center; color: #6b7280; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
            <p>본 메일은 발신전용입니다. 문의사항은 U+ 고객센터(101)로 연락주세요.</p>
            <p>© 2026 LG U+. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>